++`git diff 6dcb16651..HEAD -- apps packages frontend` 为空（[evidence/fk-guard/fk-guard-scope.txt](evidence/fk-guard/fk-guard-scope.txt)）：
++本次未触碰任何产品源码，因此 83 focused / 503 passed-143 skipped metrics / API typecheck 0 的已接受证据继续
